src:SUSPENDED-1: The game is titled *Suspension*, not *Suspended*, in most of the source code.
	I got some cheap amusement out of telling my school friends, “I got *Suspended!*” (Which everybody heard as a serious school penalty rather than a game title.)

obj:HELL: This exists only so that you can tell a robot `GO TO HELL`.

